DATASET CSV FORMATTING PROGRAM
v1.0 by Richard Pepe

Primary purpose, split string inputs into sparse binary inputs.

v1.0 is a barebones implementation. Currently no support for header files, will be added soon. 
Lots of weird, hacky logic to clean up. Very little integrity checking, program is incredibly
volatile. Can't guarantee how program will act against non fixed-width datasets (every row should
have the same number of columns).
